  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Humanitarian UXO in Easternn Savannakhet</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project &#x2018;Humanitarian UXO clearance in Eastern Savannakhet Province&#x2019;, implemented by HALO Trust, aims to reduce the number of UXO related injuries and fatalities in Savannakhet province and increase the amount of safe land available to rural communities. Activities under this project include clearance of agricultural land contaminated with cluster munitions and other UXO, and provision of mine risk education to targeted communities.</narrative>
  </description>
